+
+#### [LangGraph](https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph)
+> **Description:** LangGraph is the graph-based orchestration layer from the LangChain ecosystem for stateful, cyclical, and multi-actor agent workflows. Its README emphasizes durable execution, branching control flow, memory, human-in-the-loop checkpoints, and production-ready agent state machines rather than simple prompt pipelines. That makes it a better fit than plain chain abstractions when developers need retryable workflows, long-running sessions, or deterministic routing between tools and models. The repository is actively maintained on GitHub, uses Python as the primary language, and is distributed under the MIT License for teams that need open source agent runtime control.
+
