+
+> Best AI tools for LLM development 2026, curated as a GitHub-only awesome list for builders who want open source frameworks, local model runtimes, eval stacks, and retrieval infrastructure. Every entry below points to a public GitHub repository, excludes proprietary SaaS-only products, and is selected for practical LLM engineering work such as agents, RAG, prompt iteration, observability, and deployment.
